WEBVTT

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:21.450
<b>Muhyo & Roji's
Bureau of Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:42.000
A-Are those...

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.080
Magical tools master potions?

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.460
Roji-kun.

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:50.960
Here.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:51.930
Huh?

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:55.800
Use these. They're ordered from 
weakest to strongest, left to right.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.640
Finish it with the Magic Binding Spell

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.680
while Muhyo's Silver Armor is still active.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.830
Hang in there, Bico.

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:20.160
The medicine should kick in soon.

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:24.620
The Silver Armor!

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.920
Even without the armor,

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:30.250
I'll invoke magical law to 
send him to Hell right now.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:33.850
I told you, you can't 
keep using magical law!

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:36.060
Focusing on preparing to fight Sophie,

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:38.420
and leave things here to Roji-kun!

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:43.430
<i>She's right. We can't let Muhyo 
exhaust his strength now.</i>

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.180
<i>I have to do this.</i>

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:47.940
<i>I have Rio-sensei's talismans.</i>

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:49.440
<i>Right...</i>

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.610
Magic Binding Spell!

00:02:57.470 --> 00:02:59.490
What? Why?

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:05.480
Magic Binding Spell! Magic Binding Spell!

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.160
Why?!

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.540
You don't get it?

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.040
No, I don't!

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:15.480
Rio-sensei's talismans should 
be perfect for the job!

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:17.800
I see.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:20.490
Of course you don't get it.

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:22.180
Muhyo?

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.430
Muhyo, don't!

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:29.850
According to Magical Law Article 1224,

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:33.440
<b>Crimes: Contamination and Attempted Murder</b>

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:34.220
for the crimes of "Contamination" 
and "Attempted Murder"...

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.860
<b>Sentence: Hands of 100 Demon Princes</b>

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:38.940
I sentence you to "Hands 
of 100 Demon Princes"!

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.940
If you'd just behave 
yourself in magic prison,

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:58.760
you wouldn't become a plaything 
for the children of Hell.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.170
I told you not to use 
magical law wastefully!

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:06.740
Do you realize just how 
horrifying Sophie is?

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:10.000
And why is Roji-kun even here if not for—

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.300
Shut up! That's enough, Rio!

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:15.800
You seem to have the wrong idea here.

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:19.430
What gives a magical tools master 
the right to question my methods?

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.820
And you need to ignore this idiot.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:27.300
Instead, you just keep feeding her ego.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.480
M-Muhyo...

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.490
S-Stop...

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:38.040
I won't let you talk that 
way about my teacher!

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.300
Bico-san!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.490
Bico!

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.880
Thank you, ma'am.

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:46.500
Thank goodness!

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.400
I'm all right now.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:52.790
The potions you concocted did the trick.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:59.400
<b>Article 8 
Becoming Someone Else</b>

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.490
<i>Why, Muhyo?</i>

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:08.180
<i>Rio-sensei did all that for us.</i>

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:10.650
Look.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.160
It's the bottom level.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.590
That's where Sophie is?

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:22.740
Is it all the ectoplasm 
 that reeks of raw flesh?

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:27.300
No, <i>that</i> is why it reeks of raw flesh.

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:31.860
His face...

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.470
I think that's the body of

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:42.840
Judge Imai's assistant, Fujiwara.

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:51.150
He climbed this far up trying to stay alive 
even after Sophie tore off his face,

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:53.140
but then the Rain Dog attacked him.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:57.790
I'm sorry. My talisman caused this.

00:05:58.060 --> 00:05:59.290
Bico...

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.600
Let's go.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:07.930
We'll take care of his body 
after we get rid of Sophie.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:12.780
<i>Bico-san...</i>

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.520
No...

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.220
I want to live...

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:28.030
Am I... dead?

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:34.700
No!

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:37.580
Th-The corpse!

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:41.920
All this ectoplasm accelerated 
his spectralization!

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:46.200
Just... seven more days... 
and I could've gone home!

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:50.970
There was so much I wanted to do!

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:53.660
I wanted to see my family!

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:56.710
I want out of here!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.140
If only that talisman hadn't come off!

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:06.150
The talisman... The talisman!

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:06.550
<i>I get it... He sprouted those huge 
wings so he could get out of here.</i>

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:11.200
According to Magical Law Article 356,

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:13.720
for the crime of "Unauthorized 
Transformation"...

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:20.120
I sentence you to "The Devil's Lance"!

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:20.120
<b>The Devil's Lance</b>

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:23.430
Muhyo...

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:31.760
Muhyo, why?!

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:34.190
A judge's assistant should have

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:38.520
more than enough experience to 
get rid of a mere Rain Dog.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:41.450
He lost because he was 
careless and unprepared.

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:43.180
He doesn't deserve sympathy.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:47.620
Of course, if he atones, he might 
still be able to pass on.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:57.660
Yeah, but...

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.630
That was your third time 
invoking magical law today.

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:03.180
Can you handle any more?

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:06.710
What should I do, then?

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:11.550
Wait for that useless pen of yours to work?

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:16.180
Both you and Rio need to 
stop butting in already.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:20.330
And how long are you 
going to keep sniveling?

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:21.900
Morons.

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:28.550
Muhyo...

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:35.750
Bico! Are you here?

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:39.790
Y-You can't come in here, Judge Himukai!

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:42.140
If you're here, answer me!

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:44.580
Have you heard anything 
about Muhyo and Roji?!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:48.300
The master told us to keep the 
matter with Muhyo-sama secret!

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:49.280
Yeah, secret!

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:50.250
Hey!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.260
You idiot!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:55.530
Bico!

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:05.330
Muhyo and Roji are gone, Bico is gone...

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.100
What the heck happened?

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:11.530
This handwriting...

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:16.170
<i>It was postmarked yesterday, and it's open.</i>

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.470
<i>No sender specified...</i>

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:31.930
It must have been pretty scary

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:35.510
to have Bico's own talisman 
delivered here like this.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:42.100
A-Are you... gonna help our master?

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.720
Of course.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:51.610
This is Sophie's cell?

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:58.680
Wait a second, Muhyo!

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:03.780
Yeah... I can't sense her presence, though.

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:08.140
S-So Sophie isn't here?

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.830
A child's room? But why?

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:23.160
This cell was designed specially 
to keep Sophie calm.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:28.810
So where the heck did she go, anyway?

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:31.690
We've covered all this ground 
and still can't find her...

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:36.440
That means she might have 
already become someone else.

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:39.950
Someone else? You mentioned 
that earlier, Muhyo.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:41.980
What kind of crime is it?

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:44.950
Exactly as it sounds. A spirit 
turns into someone else.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:51.740
It takes on their form and 
lives their life as its own.

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:52.830
But...

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:57.690
Sophie becomes another person after
killing them and tearing off their face.

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:01.530
It's only to satisfy her 
own psychotic desires.

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:09.390
We should have taken into account

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:13.230
the fact that Sophie becomes other people 
when we started looking for her.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:16.650
H-Hang on... Are you saying...

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:19.650
that someone in this magic prison is...

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:21.110
Yes.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:24.080
Either one of the three jailers up top,

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:27.420
or Judge Imai, whose body wasn't found...

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:30.600
or one of the four of us...

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.810
has to be Sophie.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:40.010
<b>Beelzebub's Treasure Chest</b>

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.010
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:46.010
<b>Hades's Banquet</b>

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:46.010
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:51.930
It's so good to see you all back!

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:58.540
Don't tell those guys 
what's really going on.

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:02.090
Just tell them we sealed 
the spirit or something.

00:12:03.270 --> 00:12:05.620
H-How did it go?

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:07.450
Well...

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.820
<i>One of these people... is Sophie!</i>

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:13.080
It's finished.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.550
You've sealed it?

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:18.010
Thank goodness!

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:19.520
Yeah.

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:25.970
Furuya-kun and Iwamoto have 
plans to get engaged soon.

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:31.780
Thank you all so much.

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:35.740
The boat should be coming 
tomorrow afternoon.

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:37.480
Make yourselves at home until then.

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:39.480
Thanks for everything.

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:41.610
It's nothing. Goodbye.

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:53.120
In any case, it seems unlikely 
that any of us is Sophie.

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:55.620
I'm not so sure about that.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:13:01.210
We all split up when we searched 
the building, after all.

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:07.220
Plus, Rio was here on the 
island before the rest of us.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.680
Are you saying my teacher is Sophie?!

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:12.580
I'm just saying we should 
all be on our guard.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:17.160
There's only one way to find a spirit 
that's taken on someone's form,

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:19.940
and that's to wait until 
it gives itself away.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:23.820
I've heard Sophie's 
transformations are flawless.

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:28.460
Yes, she conceals her spirit 
energy so that no one notices.

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:33.240
I'm not saying one of us is Sophie,

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:36.800
but we... need to... be careful...

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:38.830
M-Muhyo?

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:42.040
He fell asleep.

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:45.760
It's no wonder he's tired.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:50.110
I've never heard of anyone who 
invoked such powerful magical law

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:51.600
three times in one day.

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:54.600
He looks like a child when he sleeps...

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:01.110
Who's there?

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:04.520
Did I imagine it?

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.660
I'm sorry...

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:16.990
Don't be silly. It's 
dangerous out here alone.

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:19.580
I had to go myself, anyway.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:23.880
Um, Rio-sensei... Could I talk to you?

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:25.560
I...

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:27.320
You don't understand Muhyo,

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:29.590
and you can't use talismans, right?

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:31.640
H-How did you...

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:33.740
It's written on your face.

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:38.160
You've really got it rough with Muhyo, huh?

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.730
I know I shouldn't have 
done what I did to you,

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.440
but Muhyo didn't have to 
get that mad about it!

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:48.160
Th-That's not true! I appreciated 
the talismans you gave me!

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:49.750
Is that really how you feel?

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:53.520
All I did was try to get out 
of the situation we were in.

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:57.080
Thinking in terms of your best 
interests, what I did was wrong.

00:14:57.470 --> 00:15:01.960
Once you get used to weak talismans, 
you won't be able to use strong ones.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:06.330
In a situation like that, where 
we could run into Sophie,

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:09.430
using magical law to exhaustion 
is obviously risky.

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:13.340
But Muhyo kept using it for your sake.

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:17.390
Do you know why?

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:22.170
Something similar happened 
to Bico a long time ago.

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:25.150
Here, Enchu. It's fixed.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:28.440
It writes now!

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.090
Seriously?

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:33.310
<i>Bico already had the makings 
of a magical tools master.</i>

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.660
Thanks, Bico! You're amazing!

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:35.080
It's not that big a deal.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.950
I bet you could be a magical 
tools master, like Rio-sensei!

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:41.430
I don't like her.

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:47.470
Why not? She's the magical 
tools master everybody loves!

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:50.320
Not to mention that fantastic body!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:49.970
Yoichi's Estimates

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:52.430
That's the only reason people like her.

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:55.930
Are you saying you could do better?

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:15.870
Bico-chan, try doing this 
experiment with me.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:25.920
All right, this one's really hard!

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:27.020
Try to keep—

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.830
You're the one who'd better keep up with me.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.720
I'll do the experiment on my own.

00:16:34.610 --> 00:16:35.740
I see...

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:39.810
All right. I'll let you do it, then.

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:43.690
Wait!

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:47.110
That's the wrong ingredient!

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:55.610
Being stubborn is a good thing...

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:14.200
But this is what happens when 
you combine the wrong things.

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.010
Remember that.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:19.750
S-Sensei...

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:22.820
Why did you protect me?

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:26.950
To help you become a great 
magical tools master,

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.540
this is a small price to pay.

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:42.540
Bico became my pupil after that.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:46.060
She was advanced enough to strike 
out on her own in no time, though.

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:49.020
That's how I got this scar.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:57.420
Muhyo's magical law may seem 
reckless, but just like this scar,

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:01.130
it's proof that he believes 
in your potential

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:06.790
and will put himself on the line to 
take any obstacles out of your path.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:14.540
You need to have faith in Muhyo.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:18.950
After all, you use talismans 
to help him, don't you?

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:23.740
The talismans won't respond 
to a hesitant heart.

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:31.450
<i>I was a fool to doubt him 
even in the slightest...</i>

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:35.830
Thank you so much...

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:40.300
for sharing such precious 
advice with someone like me!

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.350
I'll... For Muhyo, I'll...

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:44.780
You'd better apologize to Muhyo later.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.860
Judge... Imai...

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:55.130
Sh-She's...

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.870
This is Sophie!

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.500
Come now, Furuya-kun.

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:08.220
Sophie has been sealed away.

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:10.080
I overheard!

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:13.420
I know you guys didn't really find Sophie.

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:18.360
I heard you say that someone in 
this building is really her!

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.340
But...

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:22.380
It can't be...

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:25.560
<i>So that presence earlier...</i>

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:27.310
<i>was her.</i>

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:32.230
No, she's right.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:35.200
We kept it quiet to prevent panic...

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.730
Rio-sensei!

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:40.740
But it's true. Sophie has 
turned into someone.

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:44.240
Well, then, it has to be her!

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:46.560
Wha... It's not me!

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:49.380
Let's go! We can't trust her now!

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:53.000
Stop!

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:56.700
They're in danger! Roji-kun, 
watch things here!

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:57.380
Right!

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:03.300
I fell asleep...

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:12.500
Huh? Where are my teacher and Roji-kun?

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:15.370
Wait!

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:22.010
<i>That was definitely her voice!</i>

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:37.690
<i>You used the last of your strength</i>

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:42.220
<i>to open the door and show me the truth...</i>

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:45.640
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:49.640
<i>The one who looks like you now...</i>

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:52.500
<i>is Sophie, isn't it?</i>

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:05.070
Thank you.

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:07.740
But I don't need this.

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:11.490
I haven't needed to eat lately.

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:14.750
That is good to hear.

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:21.300
Do you think the talisman has arrived yet?

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:26.300
I believe it arrived two days ago.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:34.310
Then I'm sure Yoichi has found it 
and is making a fuss by now.

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:38.310
I do hope everything works out as intended.

00:21:38.640 --> 00:21:43.230
Don't worry. She is very clever.

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:47.300
I'm sure she'll kill them all.

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:52.020
How wonderful.

00:21:52.020 --> 00:21:54.120
I'm so envious...

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:33.970
Oh, you're very pretty.

00:23:34.480 --> 00:23:37.270
Maybe I'll take you next.

00:23:37.840 --> 00:23:41.390
Well, then, I'll have to 
take your face off, too.

00:23:42.700 --> 00:23:47.210
Next time on <i>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau 
of Supernatural Investigation</i>,

00:23:47.210 --> 00:23:48.940
Article 9:

00:23:48.940 --> 00:23:50.210
"Sophie."

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:54.950
<b>Article 9 
Sophie</b>

00:23:50.210 --> 00:23:53.100
Magical law will be enforced.
